>>SOURCE FORMAT FREE
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PAYMONEY.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 INPUT-LINE PIC X(512).
01 AMOUNT-TEXT PIC X(20).
01 FEE-TEXT PIC X(20).
01 TAX-TEXT PIC X(20).
01 AMOUNT-CENTS PIC 9(12) VALUE 0.
01 TOTAL-DEBIT PIC 9(12) VALUE 0.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN.
    ACCEPT INPUT-LINE
    UNSTRING INPUT-LINE DELIMITED BY "|"
        INTO AMOUNT-TEXT FEE-TEXT TAX-TEXT
    END-UNSTRING
    COMPUTE AMOUNT-CENTS = FUNCTION NUMVAL(AMOUNT-TEXT)
    MOVE AMOUNT-CENTS TO TOTAL-DEBIT
    DISPLAY TOTAL-DEBIT
    STOP RUN.
